        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/Paris/_scene_paris.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 3a58746c-3602-43bf-9d6c-8ce6d6befb09).Image",
        "Description": "Hello 47. Your targets are Lothair Daost, Chappell Francoeur, and Roger Dupont. Lothair, the fashion show guest and esteemed friend of both Viktor Novikov and Sebastian Sato, is a multi-millionaire gambling addict. His constant earnings and friendships with ICA dangers pose a large threat to the ICA. Both Chappell and Roger are former friends of our client, who are teaming to get an inside job with Novikov&apos;s hitman. All three pose great dangers to us and our client. Good luck 47...",
